  "description": "*“PD, please take a look at this story!!”  \n“Writer, I’m afraid this story won’t make the cut.”*\n\nA hapless webtoon artist nicknamed the Chili Pepper Fairy has failed to land a single contract since his debut work. In hopes of securing a deal for his next project, he sends all kinds of story ideas to the company, only to be rejected every time. After one refusal too many, he finally shows up outside the office late at night to confront the PD in charge…\n\n*“PD, do you know how many times you’ve rejected me now? If this one doesn’t work either, I’m seriously going to fuck you!”  \n“Ah, ah! Stop it! Ngh, stop, I said stop! Quit it, you bastard!!”*\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000073857)",
